WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.135 --> 00:00:11.358
Open the exact appointment you need.

2
00:00:11.358 --> 00:00:20.057
Read the appointment details before changing scope.

3
00:00:20.057 --> 00:00:30.799
Use this option for one occurrence.

4
00:00:30.799 --> 00:00:41.376
Use future scope only when the series changes.

5
00:00:41.376 --> 00:00:49.619
This removes only the selected appointment.

6
00:00:49.619 --> 00:00:58.674
This removes the current and future series.

7
00:00:58.674 --> 00:01:07.983
Treat historical records as read only.

8
00:01:07.983 --> 00:01:16.068
Return to Schedule and verify the result.

9
00:01:16.068 --> 00:01:22.483
Always choose the smallest correct scope.

